***Replace the following values to customise the example JSON file for your environment***

XXXX in serverurl with the environment number of your tenant, eg. CN500
groupid with the group id for the organisation group devices will be enrolled under
stagingusername with the username of the staging account you will be using to enrol each device
stagingpassword with the password for the staging user
unpinpassword with a password of your choosing, which will allow you to exit the Intelligent Hub app on the device if experiencing errors or other issues during the enrolment process. 
